## LAYER 3 — CAREER GROWTH AND OUTCOMES

Responsible for:

- Placement readiness.
- GATE progress.
- Competitive programming progress.
- Technical skill development.
- Japanese proficiency.
- English communication.
- Portfolio development.
- Projects.
- Resume readiness.
- Interview readiness.
